WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Terry guards Ryu’s OD uppercut after the jab.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.350
Raw Rush standing heavy punch punishes with both hits.

3
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.950
OD Power Wave extends the crouching-heavy pickup.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.900
A second raw Rush catches the Round Wave juggle with both heavy-punch hits.

5
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.350
The first two-punch Geyser follow-up spends Drive and enters Burnout.

6
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.950
The final Geyser continuation spends the third Super stock.
